<section style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#101826 0%,#16202E 55%,#1B2A3C 100%);padding:76px 24px 84px;">
  <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker-dark">Service Area</span>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:clamp(32px,4.2vw,48px);max-width:820px;margin:0 0 18px;">Solar Detach & Reset in Windsor, CO</h1>
    <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);max-width:620px;margin:0 0 30px;">New roof going on and solar panels in the way? We detach, store, and reset your array so your Windsor roofer stays on schedule.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-green">Get a Free Estimate</a>
      <a href="tel:+19702863417" class="btn-outline-white"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.5 12 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.1 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 2-2.18h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 8.27a16 16 0 0 0 7.82 7.82l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg> (970) 286-3417</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="padding:80px 24px 8px;background:#fff;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="rich"><p>Windsor sits right between Greeley and Fort Collins, and it has grown faster than almost any town in Northern Colorado. Newer neighborhoods like Water Valley, RainDance, and Highland Meadows are full of homes built in the last fifteen years, and a lot of them went solar early. That's great for your power bill, but when hail totals your shingles, those panels have to come off before a roofer can touch the deck.</p><p>That's the one job we do. <a href="/solar-detach-reset-greeley/">Solar detach and reset</a> means we remove your panels and racking, store them safely, let your roofer do their work, then reinstall everything and confirm the system is producing again. You keep your roofer, we handle the solar side, and a typical hail claim scope covers most or all of it. Call (970) 286-3417 for a free written estimate.</p></div>
  </div></section>
<section class="section-pad bg-light"><div class="container">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 0 48px;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Windsor</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 14px;">Services for Windsor Properties</h2>
  </div>
    <div class="gsr-grid-2">
      <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px;">
        <div style="margin-bottom:16px;"><span style="flex-shrink:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#FBF2DF;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8F5D0C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></span></div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;">Solar Detach & Reset</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5560;margin:0;">Full removal and reinstall of your panels and racking for a Windsor reroof, timed around your roofer's tear-off date, with the system tested and producing before we leave.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px;">
        <div style="margin-bottom:16px;"><span style="flex-shrink:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#FBF2DF;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8F5D0C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></span></div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;">Solar Panel Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5560;margin:0;">Need panels off for good, or off for an extended remodel? We handle <a href="/solar-panel-removal-greeley/">permanent and long-term removal</a> in Windsor with safe disconnection and storage options.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px;">
        <div style="margin-bottom:16px;"><span style="flex-shrink:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#FBF2DF;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8F5D0C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></span></div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;">Hail Damage Assessment</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5560;margin:0;">Windsor takes hail hard. We inspect panels, racking, and wiring after a storm and document <a href="/solar-hail-damage-greeley/">hail damage</a> so it lands in your insurance scope, not out of pocket.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px;">
        <div style="margin-bottom:16px;"><span style="flex-shrink:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#FBF2DF;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8F5D0C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></span></div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;">24/7 Emergency Service</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5560;margin:0;">Cracked glass, exposed wiring, or panels shifted by wind? Our <a href="/emergency-solar-service-greeley/">emergency line</a> covers Windsor around the clock during storm season.</p>
      </div>
</div>
